decks.find(deck => deck.id === "akiza").combos.push({"title":"Red Rose into Black Rose and follow-up","hand":"Red Rose Dragon + White Rose Dragon","condition":"Start with an empty field. Roxrose Dragon, Frozen Rose and Basal Rose Shoot must remain in the Deck, and Black Rose Dragon in the Extra Deck.","steps":["Normal Summon Red Rose Dragon.","Special Summon White Rose Dragon from your hand while you control Red Rose Dragon, a Dragon Tuner.","Synchro Summon Black Rose Dragon using Red Rose and White Rose. Decline Black Rose Dragon’s optional field destruction and White Rose Dragon’s optional Graveyard effect.","Activate Red Rose Dragon’s Graveyard effect: Special Summon Roxrose Dragon from the Deck, then add Frozen Rose from the Deck to your hand.","Activate Roxrose Dragon’s effect to add Basal Rose Shoot from the Deck to your hand.","Activate Basal Rose Shoot to Special Summon White Rose Dragon from the Graveyard in Defense Position."],"result":"Black Rose Dragon, Roxrose Dragon and White Rose Dragon on the field, with Frozen Rose in hand."});
decks.find(deck => deck.id === "crow").combos.push({"title":"Sudri and Vata into Black-Winged Dragon","hand":"Blackwing - Sudri the Phantom Glimmer + Blackwing - Vata the Emblem of Wandering","condition":"Start with an empty field and a second Vata in the Deck. Nothung and Black-Winged Dragon must be in the Extra Deck. For the illustrated Nothung effect, the opponent controls a face-up monster.","steps":["Normal Summon Sudri and add a second Vata from the Deck to your hand.","Special Summon the original Vata from your hand while you control Sudri.","Synchro Summon Blackwing - Nothung the Starlight using Sudri and Vata. Nothung inflicts 800 damage, then an opponent’s face-up monster loses 800 ATK/DEF.","Use Nothung’s additional Normal Summon to Normal Summon the second Vata from your hand.","Synchro Summon Black-Winged Dragon using Level 6 Nothung and Level 2 Vata."],"result":"Black-Winged Dragon on the field; the opponent has taken 800 effect damage."});
decks.find(deck => deck.id === "crow").combos.push({"title":"Full Armor Master with Twin Shadow follow-up","hand":"Blackwing - Sudri the Phantom Glimmer + Blackwing - Vata the Emblem of Wandering + Blackwing - Twin Shadow","condition":"Start with five cards and an empty field. Shamal, Simoon and Black Feather Whirlwind must be in the Deck. The final step happens on a later turn after Twin Shadow was Set.","steps":["Normal Summon Sudri and add Shamal from your Deck to your hand. Set Blackwing - Twin Shadow.","Send Shamal from your hand to the Graveyard to place Black Feather Whirlwind face-up from the Deck.","Special Summon Vata from your hand while you control Sudri.","Synchro Summon Boreastorm using Sudri and Vata.","Activate Boreastorm as Chain Link 1 to send Simoon from the Deck to the Graveyard; chain Black Feather Whirlwind as Chain Link 2 to Special Summon Sudri from the Graveyard. Boreastorm remains Level 6. Decline Shamal’s optional effect for this illustrated branch.","Synchro Summon Blackwing Full Armor Master using Level 6 Boreastorm and Level 4 Sudri. Keep Twin Shadow Set and do not activate Shamal’s optional Graveyard effect.","On a later turn, activate the previously Set Twin Shadow. Shuffle Level 2 Vata and Level 6 Simoon from the Graveyard into the Main Deck to Special Summon Black-Winged Dragon from the Extra Deck, treated as a Synchro Summon. Black Feather Whirlwind and Shamal can offer optional follow-up effects; this illustration declines both."],"result":"Full Armor Master and Black Feather Whirlwind remain; on a later turn Twin Shadow can add Black-Winged Dragon. Simoon itself has no Graveyard effect; sending it supplies Level 6 non-Tuner material for Twin Shadow."});
decks.find(deck=>deck.id==="odd-eyes").combos=[{"id":"odd-eyes","title":"Pendulum Summon into Odd-Eyes Override Dragon","hand":"Odd-Eyes Persona Dragon + Odd-Eyes Mirage Dragon + Odd-Eyes Arc Pendulum Dragon + Odd-Eyes Arc Pendulum Dragon + Performapal Skullcrobat Joker","condition":"Start with an empty field; Persona and Mirage provide scales 1 and 8. Override is in the Extra Deck.","result":"Odd-Eyes Override Dragon, both scales, and three face-up Pendulum Monsters in the Extra Deck.","steps":["Activate Persona Dragon and Mirage Dragon in your Pendulum Zones.","Pendulum Summon two Odd-Eyes Arc Pendulum Dragons and Performapal Skullcrobat Joker from your hand. Do not apply Joker’s effect: it was not Normal Summoned.","Link Summon Odd-Eyes Override Dragon using all three monsters. They go face-up to the Extra Deck; both scales remain."]},{"id":"odd-eyes","title":"Two scales into Odd-Eyes Absolute Dragon","hand":"Odd-Eyes Persona Dragon + Odd-Eyes Mirage Dragon + Odd-Eyes Arc Pendulum Dragon + Odd-Eyes Arc Pendulum Dragon","condition":"Start with an empty field; Persona and Mirage provide scales 1 and 8. Absolute Dragon is in the Extra Deck.","result":"Odd-Eyes Absolute Dragon with both Arc Pendulum Dragons attached as Xyz Materials; both scales remain.","steps":["Activate Persona Dragon and Mirage Dragon in your Pendulum Zones.","Pendulum Summon both Level 7 Odd-Eyes Arc Pendulum Dragons from your hand.","Xyz Summon Odd-Eyes Absolute Dragon using the two Level 7 Dragons. They remain attached as Xyz Materials, not in the Graveyard or face-up Extra Deck."]},{"id":"odd-eyes","title":"Dissolver into Odd-Eyes Vortex Dragon","hand":"Performapal Odd-Eyes Dissolver + Odd-Eyes Arc Pendulum Dragon + Performapal Skullcrobat Joker","condition":"Vortex Dragon is in the Extra Deck. The monsters are used from the hand; no Pendulum Summon is required.","result":"Odd-Eyes Vortex Dragon and Dissolver in its Pendulum Zone. Its negate needs a face-up Pendulum Monster in the Extra Deck, which this line does not provide by itself.","steps":["Activate Performapal Odd-Eyes Dissolver in a Pendulum Zone.","Activate Dissolver’s Pendulum Effect. Fusion Summon Odd-Eyes Vortex Dragon using Odd-Eyes Arc Pendulum Dragon and Performapal Skullcrobat Joker from your hand. Both materials go to the Graveyard."]}];
decks.find(deck=>deck.id==="lunalight").combos=[{"id":"lunalight","title":"Lunalight Fusion into Liger Dancer","hand":"Lunalight Fusion + Lunalight Gold Leo + Lunalight Black Sheep + Lunalight Black Sheep","condition":"Your opponent controls a monster Special Summoned from the Extra Deck; Leo Dancer and Liger Dancer are in your Extra Deck.","result":"Lunalight Liger Dancer, using exactly one Extra Deck material.","steps":["Activate Lunalight Fusion: use Lunalight Leo Dancer from the Extra Deck and Gold Leo plus two Black Sheep from your hand. Fusion Summon Liger Dancer. Decline Black Sheep’s optional recovery for this illustration."]},{"id":"lunalight","title":"Black Sheep into Sabre Dancer","hand":"Lunalight Black Sheep + Lunalight Black Sheep + Lunalight Gold Leo + Lunalight Yellow Marten","condition":"Polymerization is in the Deck and Sabre Dancer is in the Extra Deck.","result":"Lunalight Sabre Dancer, with four Beast-Warrior monsters in the Graveyard.","steps":["Discard one Black Sheep to add Polymerization from your Deck.","Activate Polymerization, using the second Black Sheep, Gold Leo and Yellow Marten from your hand to Fusion Summon Sabre Dancer. Decline their optional Graveyard effects for this illustration."]},{"id":"lunalight","title":"Perfume Dancer with Kaleido Chick follow-up","hand":"Polymerization + Lunalight Gold Leo + Lunalight Kaleido Chick","condition":"Luna Light Perfume remains in the Deck and Perfume Dancer is in the Extra Deck.","result":"Lunalight Perfume Dancer and Lunalight Kaleido Chick on the field.","steps":["Activate Polymerization using Gold Leo and Kaleido Chick from your hand to Fusion Summon Perfume Dancer. Decline Kaleido Chick’s optional recovery.","Activate Perfume Dancer’s Fusion Summon effect to add Luna Light Perfume from the Deck.","Activate Luna Light Perfume and target Kaleido Chick in the Graveyard to Special Summon it."]}];
decks.find(deck=>deck.id==="speedroid").combos=[{"id":"speedroid","title":"Wing Synchron into Crystal Clear Wing Over","hand":"Speedroid Wing Synchron + Speedroid Marble Machine + Speedroid CarTurbo + Speedroid Red-Eyed Dice","condition":"Start with an empty field and your Normal Summon available. Clear Wing and Crystal Clear Wing Over are in the Extra Deck.","result":"Crystal Clear Wing Over Synchro Dragon, with Wing Synchron and Marble Machine face-up in the Extra Deck.","steps":["Activate Wing Synchron and Marble Machine in your Pendulum Zones.","Use Wing Synchron’s Pendulum Effect to destroy both scales and Special Summon Clear Wing Synchro Dragon from the Extra Deck, treated as a Synchro Summon. You can only Special Summon WIND monsters for the rest of the turn.","Special Summon CarTurbo from your hand because you control a WIND monster. You cannot activate non-WIND monster effects for the rest of the turn.","Normal Summon Red-Eyed Dice. Activate its effect to change CarTurbo from Level 3 to Level 4.","Synchro Summon Crystal Clear Wing Over using Level 7 Clear Wing, Level 4 CarTurbo and Level 1 Red-Eyed Dice. Its listed materials allow two or more Tuners with Clear Wing."]},{"id":"speedroid","title":"Terrortop into Clear Wing Synchro Dragon","hand":"Speedroid Terrortop","condition":"Start with an empty field and your Normal Summon available; Marble Machine, Taketomborg and Red-Eyed Dice remain in the Deck.","result":"Clear Wing Synchro Dragon and Marble Machine, with a WIND-only Special Summon restriction for the rest of the turn.","steps":["Special Summon Terrortop because you control no monsters, then add Marble Machine from your Deck.","Normal Summon Marble Machine and add Taketomborg from the Deck.","Special Summon Taketomborg from your hand while you control a WIND monster.","Tribute Taketomborg to Special Summon Red-Eyed Dice from the Deck; further Special Summons this turn must be WIND.","Activate Dice to change Terrortop to Level 6.","Synchro Summon Clear Wing using Level 6 Terrortop and Level 1 Dice; Marble Machine stays where it is."]},{"id":"speedroid","title":"Marble Machine into Hi-Speedroid Chanbara","hand":"Speedroid Marble Machine","condition":"Start with your Normal Summon available; Taketomborg and Red-Eyed Dice remain in the Deck.","result":"Hi-Speedroid Chanbara, which can make a second attack during each Battle Phase.","steps":["Normal Summon Marble Machine and add Taketomborg from the Deck.","Special Summon Taketomborg from your hand while you control Marble Machine.","Tribute Taketomborg to Special Summon Red-Eyed Dice from your Deck. You can only Special Summon WIND monsters for the rest of the turn.","Activate Dice’s effect to change Marble Machine to Level 4.","Synchro Summon Hi-Speedroid Chanbara using Level 4 Marble Machine and Level 1 Dice. Marble Machine is placed face-up in the Extra Deck."]}];
decks.find(deck=>deck.id==="chronicles").combos=[{"id":"chronicles","title":"Cartesia into The Dragon that Devours the Dogma","hand":"Blazing Cartesia, the Virtuous + Fallen of Albaz + Tri-Brigade Mercourier","condition":"Your Normal Summon is available; The Dragon that Devours the Dogma is in the Extra Deck.","result":"The Dragon that Devours the Dogma on the field, with Cartesia, Fallen of Albaz, and Mercourier in the Graveyard.","steps":["Normal Summon Blazing Cartesia, the Virtuous.","Activate Cartesia’s Fusion effect. Use Cartesia on the field as the LIGHT monster, Fallen of Albaz and Tri-Brigade Mercourier from your hand as the named material and Effect Monster, respectively, to Fusion Summon The Dragon that Devours the Dogma. Decline its optional shuffle effect."]},{"id":"chronicles","title":"Branded Fusion into Mirrorjade","hand":"Branded Fusion + Branded in Red","condition":"Fallen of Albaz and Despian Tragedy are in the Deck; Lubellion and Mirrorjade are in the Extra Deck. Branded in Red is the illustrated discard.","result":"Mirrorjade and Aluber in hand; Fallen of Albaz and Lubellion have been shuffled back to their respective Decks.","steps":["Activate Branded Fusion. Send Fallen of Albaz and Despian Tragedy from the Deck to the Graveyard to Fusion Summon Lubellion.","After Fusion Summoning Lubellion, activate its effect as Chain Link 1, discarding Branded in Red as the cost. Activate Tragedy as Chain Link 2; it resolves first and adds Aluber from the Deck.","Resolve Lubellion: shuffle it from the field into the Extra Deck and Fallen of Albaz from the Graveyard into the Main Deck to Fusion Summon Mirrorjade. Branded Fusion allows only Fusion Special Summons from the Extra Deck throughout this turn."]},{"id":"chronicles","title":"Branded Fusion into Rindbrumm","hand":"Branded Fusion","condition":"Fallen of Albaz and Tri-Brigade Mercourier remain in the Deck; Rindbrumm is in the Extra Deck.","result":"Rindbrumm the Striking Dragon, with Fallen of Albaz and Mercourier in the Graveyard.","steps":["Activate Branded Fusion, sending Fallen of Albaz and Winged Beast Tri-Brigade Mercourier from the Deck to the Graveyard to Fusion Summon Rindbrumm. Branded Fusion allows only Fusion Special Summons from the Extra Deck this turn."]}];
